OL,3,CReading FC Community Trust recognised
OL,4,Cas one of EFL's leading charities
OL,6,FReading FC Community Trust has been
OL,7,Frecognised as one of English Football
OL,8,FLeague's (EFL) leading charities.
OL,10,FThe organization, which works to
OL,11,Fchange lives through health, education
OL,12,Fand inclusion, generated almost #21
OL,13,Fmillion in social value during the
OL,14,F2024/25 season, one of the strongest
OL,15,Freturns across the EFL.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
