OL,3,CReading FC Community Trust recognised
OL,4,Cas one of EFL's leading charities
OL,6,FSocial value refers to the broader
OL,7,Fbenefits that an organisation brings
OL,8,Fto society - quantifying positive
OL,9,Fimpacts such as local job creation,
OL,10,Freduced carbon emissions and community
OL,11,Fwellbeing.
OL,13,FThe EFL's annual community report
OL,14,Ffound that club community
OL,15,Forganisations collectively reached
OL,16,Fmore than 1.2 million people during
OL,17,Fthe season, generating over #1.42
OL,18,Fbillion in social value.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
