OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785500324
OL,3,CReading FC Community Trust recognised
OL,4,Cas one of EFL's leading charities
OL,6,FReading FC Community Trust's
OL,7,Fcontribution of almost #21 million
OL,8,Frepresents a return of #9.12 for every
OL,9,F#1 invested in its work, with an
OL,10,Faverage social value of #1,414 per
OL,11,Fparticipant.
OL,13,FThe trust is an independent registered
OL,14,Fcharity with its own governance and
OL,15,Ffinances but works under Reading FC's
OL,16,Fname to deliver programmes across
OL,17,FReading and Berkshire.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
