OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785500324
OL,3,CReading FC Community Trust recognised
OL,4,Cas one of EFL's leading charities
OL,6,FIts work spans education, health and
OL,7,Fwellbeing, inclusion and community
OL,8,Fengagement, from Premier League Kicks
OL,9,Fsessions in some of the area's most
OL,10,Fdisadvantaged neighbourhoods to
OL,11,Fdisability sport, mentoring programmes
OL,12,Fand football opportunities for people
OL,13,Fof all ages and abilities.
OL,15,FIt's funded through a combination of
OL,16,Fgrant income, corporate partnerships
OL,17,Fand charitable support.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
