OL,3,CReading FC Community Trust recognised
OL,4,Cas one of EFL's leading charities
OL,6,FJoe Jacobson, Chief Executive of
OL,7,FReading Football Club, said: "We are
OL,8,Fincredibly proud of Reading FC
OL,9,FCommunity Trust. This football club
OL,10,Fhas always stood for far more than
OL,11,Fwhat happens for 90 minutes on a
OL,12,Fmatchday, and the Trust demonstrates
OL,13,Fthat every single day.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
