PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785500324
OL,3,CReading FC Community Trust recognised
OL,4,Cas one of EFL's leading charities
OL,6,F"Generating almost #21 million in
OL,7,Fsocial value in a single season is an
OL,8,Foutstanding achievement, but the real
OL,9,Fimpact is measured in the lives that
OL,10,Fhave been changed ` young people
OL,11,Fdiscovering new opportunities,
OL,12,Fchildren finding a sense of belonging,
OL,13,Fand families receiving support when
OL,14,Fthey need it most.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
