OL,3,CReading FC Community Trust recognised
OL,4,Cas one of EFL's leading charities
OL,6,F"The Club and the Trust work hand in
OL,7,Fhand to make a positive difference
OL,8,Facross Reading and Berkshire. To
OL,9,Feveryone involved in delivering that
OL,10,Fwork, thank you. You represent this
OL,11,Ffootball club with tremendous pride
OL,12,Fand make an extraordinary difference
OL,13,Fto our community."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
